Then pOH = -log(3.29e-6) ≈ 5.485, so pH = 14 - 5.485 ≈ 8.515. Which is approximately 8.52. That matches option C's second value of 8.52. So the answer should be option C: 4.26; 8.52.

But let me check if there's any mistake here. Let me recompute the [OH⁻] calculation.

