For p2, p2² = [p0 - sqrt((E - Δ)/b)]² = p0² - 2 p0 sqrt((E - Δ)/b) + (E - Δ)/b.

Adding these two terms together: p1² + p2² = 2p0² + 2*(E - Δ)/b.

