","[""3-cyano-6-(dimethylamino)-5-formyl-2-hydroxy-4-methoxybenzoic acid"", ""2-(dimethylamino)-3-formyl-4-methoxy-5-cyano-6-hydroxybenzoic acid"", ""5-cyano-2-(dimethylamino)-3-formyl-6-hydroxy-4-methoxybenzoic acid"", ""2-hydroxy-3-cyano-4-methoxy-5-formyl-6-(dimethylamino)benzoic acid""]",A,"Okay, let's try to figure out this IUPAC name. The question is about a benzene ring with several substituents. Let me start by recalling the rules for naming substituted benzene rings. 

