Wait, γ = 4 / 1.48 ≈ 2.7027. Then 1/γ² is (1.48/4)² = (0.37)² = 0.1369. So yes. Then 1 - 0.1369 = 0.8631. Square root of that is approximately sqrt(0.8631). Let me compute sqrt(0.8631). Since 0.93² = 0.8649, which is a bit higher than 0.8631. So sqrt(0.8631) ≈ 0.929. So v ≈ 0.929c. So approximately 0.929 times the speed of light.

