γ² = (4/1.48)^2 ≈ (2.7027)^2 ≈ 7.305. So 1/γ² ≈ 0.1369. Then 1 - 0.1369 = 0.8631. sqrt(0.8631). Let me compute that more accurately.

Let me compute sqrt(0.8631). Let's use a better approximation. Let's note that 0.929^2 = 0.863041, which is very close to 0.8631. So sqrt(0.8631) ≈ 0.929. So v ≈ 0.929c. So exact value is about 0.929c.

