Simplify the right side:

(4/3)MgR [ (1 - cosα) - (1 - cosθ) ] = (4/3)MgR (cosθ - cosα)

Then:

θ̇² = [ (8/3)gR (cosθ - cosα) ] / R² ?

Wait, let me do the math again. Let me divide both sides by (1/2)MR²:

θ̇² = [ (4/3)MgR (cosθ - cosα) ] * 2 / (MR² )

