In some studies, HR4 is involved in the defense against powdery mildew pathogens. For example, the HIN1 gene (HR4) is a resistance gene against powdery mildew. So B is correct. But also, HR4 interacts with PAD4, so E is correct. However, if the options are exclusive, maybe the answer is E.

