hle,Who became the next voivode after Ivan Ivanovich Golovin in the city of Pskov in 1700?,"[""Boris Petrovich Sheremetev"", ""Peter Matveevich Apraksin"", ""Mikhail Mikhailovich Golitsyn"", ""Vasily Borisovich Bukhvostov"", ""Fyodor Yuryevich Romodanovsky""]",D,"Okay, let's try to figure this out. The question is asking who became the next voivode after Ivan Ivanovich Golovin in Pskov in 1700. The options are A through E, each with different names.

