log(1.07) = 0.0294, log(1.08) = 0.0334. The difference between 1.07 and 1.08 is 0.01. The value 1.075 is halfway, so log(1.075) ≈ 0.0294 + (0.0334 - 0.0294)/2 = 0.0294 + 0.002 = 0.0314. Therefore, log(4.3) = log(4) + log(1.075) ≈ 0.60206 + 0.0314 = 0.6335. So pKa = 7 - 0.6335 = 6.3665, as before. So pH - pKa = 7.40 - 6.3665 = 1.0335. Then 10^1.0335.

