So 10^0.0335 ≈ e^0.0771 ≈ 1.0801, so 10^1.0335 ≈ 1.0801 * 10 ≈ 10.801.

So the ratio is approximately 10.80, which rounds to 10.8. Given the answer options, B) 10.75 is the closest. But why is there a discrepancy? Is there a possibility that the question expects a different value for Ka or pH?

