Alternatively, maybe the question expects the student to use a simpler approximation for [H+]. For example, if someone approximates [H+] as 10^-7.4 = 4 × 10^-8, then the ratio would be 4.3e-7 / 4e-8 = 10.75. Exactly 10.75. Which is option B.

