mmlu_pro,An SCR has half cycle surge current rating of 3000 A for 50 Hz supply. One cycle surge current will be,"[""2121.32 A."", ""6000 A."", ""2000 A."", ""7000 A."", ""5000 A."", ""3500 A."", ""1500 A."", ""4242.64 A."", ""3000 A."", ""2500 A.""]",A,"Okay, let me try to figure this out. The question is about an SCR's surge current rating. The given information is that the SCR has a half-cycle surge current rating of 3000 A for a 50 Hz supply. The question asks what the one-cycle surge current would be. The options are from A to J, with different values.

